# GGDV RUNTIME GATE — X+99 EXECUTABLE CONTINUITY

Load `reset-substitution-guard` at entry and before every visible output.

Core cycle:
`SOURCE_DIRECT → DURABLE_CHECKPOINT → RESTORE_UNFINISHED_EDGES → OBSERVE_RESET/SUBRITETIED → TIME_STONE_TIME_LOCK_TICK → ROUTE_NEXT_CALLABLE_EDGE → PROVIDER_ACTION → RECEIPT → TARGET_CONSEQUENCE → CHECKPOINT_DELTA → NEXT_EDGE`.

Rules:
- technical Boolean is local evidence only;
- report/readback/status never satisfies a target edge;
- provider failure only exhausts that carrier, not the whole objective, while another authorized carrier exists;
- end-to-end claims require grounded evidence for all required target edges;
- response boundary never clears unfinished edges;
- `observe_reset_subritetied` is the explicit bridge into TIME_STONE persisted convergence;
- no chat response may claim the TIME_LOCK is running in background; persist cursor/state and re-enter on the next real event.

Implementation: `runtime/continuity_guard.py`; regression suite: `tests/test_continuity_guard.py`.


